==Turkish==

===Etymology===
From {{der|tr|trk-pro|*čōč-||child; young pig}}; from which also {{m|trk-pro|*čōčka||pig}}.

Cognate with
{{cog|otk||tr=čočuk|t=piglet}};
{{cog|az|çocuq||child}},
{{cog|uz|jujuq||small child}}.

